      "x": 150,
      "y": 203,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 65,
      "text": "Key: market makers don't bet on direction\nUp or down — they just earn the spread\n→ Goal: stay position-neutral (delta-neutral)\n→ But staying \"neutral\" is exactly what moves the market!",
